SOURCE AUDIT
- src/model/model.cpp:55-172 validates non-empty/unique IDs, state/function
  references, typed argument bindings, duplicate producers, and ordering cycles;
  limits reject zero max_steps/max_subprocesses at lines 109-115. No unchecked
  indexing or raw ownership was found.
- src/spec/spec.cpp:19-33 parses RFC8259 forms with bounds checks before every
  indexed read; duplicate object keys and non-finite/overflow numbers are
  rejected. Lines 44-60 enforce strict schema and canonical deterministic JSON.
- src/generate/generate.cpp:17-91 sorts transition choices by ID, tracks emitted
  sequences, and checks max_cases/max_steps before recursion. The seed is
  intentionally ignored (determinism is covered by generator_determinism).
- src/runtime/runtime.cpp:72-105 canonicalizes and allowlists executables;
  lines 107-130 use fork/execve with a fixed environment, process group,
  nonblocking poll, step deadline, output cap, kill/wait cleanup, and bounded
  protocol checks. Runtime pass/mismatch/malformed/extra/timeout/crash/cap tests
  all pass under ASan/UBSan/LSan.
- src/report/report.cpp:5-15 escapes JSON/text fields and emits bounded per-flow
  reports; src/cli/cli.cpp:92-223 maps parse, generation, runtime, and usage
  failures to stable exit codes and records wall/CPU/RSS measurements.
- CMakeLists.txt:12-42 wires address, undefined-behavior, and leak sanitizers;
  CMakeLists.txt:53-120 registers all 18 functional tests. README.md:98-120
  documents the sanitizer workflow and optional Valgrind check.

